 "01-Castle-Skull-Ball-2560x1440.png", "id": "1042304918866107", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673751957_1042304922199440_6330110968676127974_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yI-uiEJ2jgAQ7kNvwGjSbbs&_nc_oc=AdoG9fBM-A5gTDFYN9rQdeIk9Emz59b_3I_AKRLpCLAM9lm2AlzQY5UzYxE-Ms1wNOo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRs4lFgW99MBNGAq7ENCCBtPG04SNYBIdgVZF4JGxz9aw&oe=6AF719EF"}, {"file_name": "8de40dca0d064c34abace4960d3bc2ca.png", "id": "2861194060947371", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831393_2861194064280704_8927421493892781177_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sFy0Hvex5RcQ7kNvwHHEUC5&_nc_oc=AdoZQarZHd1N-AFvsu4JSt6ZUwPQYyHq2xwmFctolG_h1RfRymFctFAz9p_f3LMlAp8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQSPeB-ndvdx17yQAEzKrHzg6UzNXeGM6faZGIt0Wj2EQ&oe=6AF716C2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "universal2.png", "id": "1114707100994978", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604360590_1114707104328311_4379849421679991338_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SKbiED9BNyMQ7kNvwFlb-He&_nc_oc=Ado0s5icaCKKxNZSLPKZWCqk6rgypEohuWZm-_CjDNoZiiHxl4SCDG-PDcbMs8ngloY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRIuVwfilcQc2dLl66cyrEwaHiLL8pJAPGFU4WUjB14oQ&oe=6AF73FF0"}, "display_name": "Not Like Horse", "keywords": ["baseketball", "basketball", "baseball", "multiplayer", "sports"], "long_description": "Early Access. Lower price. More to come.\n\nJump in with eight courts, solo play, and online multiplayer at a reduced Early Access price. Environment improvements, more customization, and general polish are planned as we work toward full release.\n\nBasketball shots. Baseball stakes.\n\nNot Like Horse brings baseketball to VR: sink baskets to advance runners and bring them home. Choose shooting spots worth singles, doubles, triples, or a home run, then put your jumper\u2014and your judgment\u2014to the test.\n\nTake the closer shot to keep runners moving, or go deep and try to clear the bases. Every inning brings another chance to pull ahead, mount a comeback, or discover that confidence and accuracy are two very different things.\n\n\u2022 Pick your shot. Make it count. Choose from ten shooting positions with different distances, angles, and stakes.\n\n\u2022 Make the miss matter. Grab a defensive rebound and sink a quick return shot to turn your opponent\u2019s miss into a double play.\n\n\u2022 Find your competition. Practice your shooting, take on AI opponents, or challenge friends in online multiplayer. Rematches are an excellent way to insist the first game didn\u2019t count.\n\n\u2022 Eight courts. Some unusual company. Discover eight distinct places to play, each with its own atmosphere and personality. We\u2019ll leave the introductions to the game.\n\nThe price will increase at full release. Early Access owners receive the full-release update at no additional cost.\n\nStep up. Take your shot. Bring it home.", "short_description": "Basketball shots. Baseball stakes. Play baseketball in VR: sink baskets, advance runners, and turn defensive rebounds into double plays. Take on AI or challenge friends online across eight courts. Early Access at a lower price, with more customization, environment improvements, and general polish to come."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://enzolucagames.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "EnzoLuca Games", "support_website_url": "https://enzolucagames.com/support/", "website_url": "https://enzolucagames.com/not-like-horse/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "h